      "value": "Tested one more time from the website, this time, it didn't crash me, but, it still has this issue. so, in open beta, the bug is worse and seems to always load the collision matrix in the wrong order of loading the world. \nthe square all the cards were forced into, in the screenshot above, is the open square without the collider that keeps the dice in the middle\n\nthe collision matrix does work by the time you load in, so, the cards can be moved freely by the time you go and try to test them",
